[2026-03-15T23:24:51.294Z] {"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Qij4nSUNU8gjz2wPwH71Wr","type":"tool_result","content":"     1→# LinearClone Test Specification\n     2→\n     3→## Login Page (`/login`)\n     4→\n     5→**Components**: LoginForm\n     6→\n     7→### LoginForm\n     8→\n     9→#### Test: Login form renders with email and password fields\n    10→- **Initial state**: User navigates to `/login` (not authenticated)\n    11→- **Expected**: The page displays an email input field, a password input field, a \"Sign in\" button, and a \"Sign up\" link. The form has a clean, centered layout with the app branding.\n    12→\n    13→#### Test: Successful login with valid credentials\n    14→- **Initial state**: A user account exists with email \"user@test.com\" and password \"password123\"\n    15→- **Action**: User enters \"user@test.com\" in the email field, \"password123\" in the password field, and clicks the \"Sign in\" button\n    16→- **Expected**: User is redirected to `/my-issues`. A session token is stored in localStorage. The sidebar navigation is visible.\n    17→\n    18→#### Test: Login fails with invalid email\n    19→- **Initial state**: User is on `/login`\n    20→- **Action**: User enters \"nonexistent@test.com\" in the email field, \"password123\" in the password field, and clicks \"Sign in\"\n    21→- **Expected**: An error message is displayed (e.g., \"Invalid email or password\"). The user remains on the login page. No session token is stored.\n    22→\n    23→#### Test: Login fails with incorrect password\n    24→- **Initial state**: A user account exists with email \"user@test.com\". User is on `/login`.\n    25→- **Action**: User enters \"user@test.com\" in email, \"wrongpassword\" in password, and clicks \"Sign in\"\n    26→- **Expected**: An error message is displayed (e.g., \"Invalid email or password\"). The user remains on the login page.\n    27→\n    28→#### Test: Login form validates required fields\n    29→- **Initial state**: User is on `/login`\n    30→- **Action**: User clicks \"Sign in\" without entering email or password\n    31→- **Expected**: Validation errors are shown for both email and password fields indicating they are required.\n    32→\n    33→#### Test: Login form validates email format\n    34→- **Initial state**: User is on `/login`\n    35→- **Action**: User enters \"notanemail\" in the email field and clicks \"Sign in\"\n    36→- **Expected**: A validation error is shown indicating the email format is invalid.\n    37→\n    38→#### Test: Navigate to sign up page from login\n    39→- **Initial state**: User is on `/login`\n    40→- **Action**: User clicks the \"Sign up\" link\n    41→- **Expected**: User is navigated to `/signup`.\n    42→\n    43→#### Test: Password field masks input\n    44→- **Initial state**: User is on `/login`\n    45→- **Action**: User types in the password field\n    46→- **Expected**: The input is masked (displayed as dots/bullets), the field type is \"password\".\n    47→\n    48→#### Test: Login form can be submitted via Enter key\n    49→- **Initial state**: User is on `/login`, has entered valid email and password\n    50→- **Action**: User presses Enter while focused on the password field"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"1880e500-2182-4a27-9a5d-5f74c5e8203c","uuid":"848576ac-c1dd-412f-8b4f-71751572dd37","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/repo/apps/LinearClone/docs/tests.md","content":"# LinearClone Test Specification\n\n## Login Page (`/login`)\n\n**Components**: LoginForm\n\n### LoginForm\n\n#### Test: Login form renders with email and password fields\n- **Initial state**: User navigates to `/login` (not authenticated)\n- **Expected**: The page displays an email input field, a password input field, a \"Sign in\" button, and a \"Sign up\" link. The form has a clean, centered layout with the app branding.\n\n#### Test: Successful login with valid credentials\n- **Initial state**: A user account exists with email \"user@test.com\" and password \"password123\"\n- **Action**: User enters \"user@test.com\" in the email field, \"password123\" in the password field, and clicks the \"Sign in\" button\n- **Expected**: User is redirected to `/my-issues`. A session token is stored in localStorage. The sidebar navigation is visible.\n\n#### Test: Login fails with invalid email\n- **Initial state**: User is on `/login`\n- **Action**: User enters \"nonexistent@test.com\" in the email field, \"password123\" in the password field, and clicks \"Sign in\"\n- **Expected**: An error message is displayed (e.g., \"Invalid email or password\"). The user remains on the login page. No session token is stored.\n\n#### Test: Login fails with incorrect password\n- **Initial state**: A user account exists with email \"user@test.com\". User is on `/login`.\n- **Action**: User enters \"user@test.com\" in email, \"wrongpassword\" in password, and clicks \"Sign in\"\n- **Expected**: An error message is displayed (e.g., \"Invalid email or password\"). The user remains on the login page.\n\n#### Test: Login form validates required fields\n- **Initial state**: User is on `/login`\n- **Action**: User clicks \"Sign in\" without entering email or password\n- **Expected**: Validation errors are shown for both email and password fields indicating they are required.\n\n#### Test: Login form validates email format\n- **Initial state**: User is on `/login`\n- **Action**: User enters \"notanemail\" in the email field and clicks \"Sign in\"\n- **Expected**: A validation error is shown indicating the email format is invalid.\n\n#### Test: Navigate to sign up page from login\n- **Initial state**: User is on `/login`\n- **Action**: User clicks the \"Sign up\" link\n- **Expected**: User is navigated to `/signup`.\n\n#### Test: Password field masks input\n- **Initial state**: User is on `/login`\n- **Action**: User types in the password field\n- **Expected**: The input is masked (displayed as dots/bullets), the field type is \"password\".\n\n#### Test: Login form can be submitted via Enter key\n- **Initial state**: User is on `/login`, has entered valid email and password\n- **Action**: User presses Enter while focused on the password field","numLines":50,"startLine":1,"totalLines":2686}}}
