[2026-03-16T00:15:44.774Z] {"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Xy6yiwScBfZFDHgz2vEUAq","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Perfect! I have all the information needed. Let me compile my findings:\n\n## Summary\n\nI've found the exact flow for cycle row clicking and cycle detail rendering. Here are the findings:\n\n### Component that handles cycle row clicks: **CycleList.tsx**\n\n**File:** `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/components/CycleList.tsx`\n\nThe cycle-row button is at line 49-54:\n```javascript\n<button\n  key={cycle.id}\n  className={`cycle-list-row ${cycle.isActive ? 'cycle-list-row-active' : ''} ${isSelected ? 'cycle-list-row-selected' : ''}`}\n  onClick={() => onSelectCycle(cycle.id)}\n  data-testid={`cycle-row-${cycle.id}`}\n>\n```\n\nThis calls the `onSelectCycle` callback prop with the cycle ID.\n\n### How the flow works: **ActiveCycle.tsx**\n\n**File:** `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/pages/ActiveCycle.tsx`\n\nThe `CycleList` component receives the `onSelectCycle` handler at line 115:\n```javascript\n<CycleList\n  cycles={cycles}\n  loading={loading}\n  selectedCycleId={selectedCycleId}\n  onSelectCycle={handleSelectCycle}\n/>\n```\n\nThe `handleSelectCycle` function at line 55-57 dispatches `setSelectedCycleId`:\n```javascript\nfunction handleSelectCycle(cycleId: string) {\n  dispatch(setSelectedCycleId(cycleId));\n}\n```\n\n### Dispatch order when a cycle is clicked:\n\n1. **First dispatch:** `setSelectedCycleId(cycleId)` (line 56 in ActiveCycle.tsx)\n   - This is a synchronous reducer action that updates `selectedCycleId` in Redux state\n\n2. **Second dispatch:** `fetchCycleIssues(selectedCycleId)` (line 51 in ActiveCycle.tsx)\n   - This is triggered by a `useEffect` hook that watches `selectedCycleId` (lines 49-53)\n   - The effect only runs when `selectedCycleId` changes, so it fires *after* `setSelectedCycleId` completes\n   - This async thunk fetches the cycle detail data\n\n### CycleDetail conditional rendering: **CycleDetail.tsx**\n\n**File:** `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/components/CycleDetail.tsx`\n\nLine 255 shows the conditional rendering:\n```javascript\nif (!cycleDetail) return null;\n```\n\nThe component returns `null` if `cycleDetail` is null, preventing any rendering.\n\n**Additionally, in ActiveCycle.tsx** (lines 108-109):\n```javascript\n{selectedCycleId && cycleDetail ? (\n  <CycleDetail />\n) : (\n```\n\nThe `CycleDetail` component is only rendered if BOTH `selectedCycleId` AND `cycleDetail` are truthy. This ensures the component isn't even mounted until both conditions are met.\n\n### Test IDs found:\n- **cycle-row** test ID: `cycle-row-${cycle.id}` (line 53 in CycleList.tsx)\n- **cycle-detail** test ID: `cycle-detail` (line 305 in CycleDetail.tsx)"},{"type":"text","text":"agentId: a714e0f97c33b34dc (for resuming to continue this agent's work if needed)\n<usage>total_tokens: 33511\ntool_uses: 8\nduration_ms: 12595</usage>"}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"1880e500-2182-4a27-9a5d-5f74c5e8203c","uuid":"fcaac8d1-b194-4358-a30b-57aaf17c11f7","tool_use_result":{"status":"completed","prompt":"In /repo/apps/LinearClone/src, find the component that handles clicking a cycle row (cycle-row testid) and dispatches setSelectedCycleId and fetchCycleIssues. I need to understand the exact flow when a cycle is clicked - what gets dispatched and in what order. Also find the component that renders `cycle-detail` testid and check if it conditionally renders based on cycleDetail being non-null. Search thoroughly - check for \"cycle-row\", \"setSelectedCycleId\", \"fetchCycleIssues\", \"cycle-detail\" test IDs.","agentId":"a714e0f97c33b34dc","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Perfect! I have all the information needed. Let me compile my findings:\n\n## Summary\n\nI've found the exact flow for cycle row clicking and cycle detail rendering. Here are the findings:\n\n### Component that handles cycle row clicks: **CycleList.tsx**\n\n**File:** `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/components/CycleList.tsx`\n\nThe cycle-row button is at line 49-54:\n```javascript\n<button\n  key={cycle.id}\n  className={`cycle-list-row ${cycle.isActive ? 'cycle-list-row-active' : ''} ${isSelected ? 'cycle-list-row-selected' : ''}`}\n  onClick={() => onSelectCycle(cycle.id)}\n  data-testid={`cycle-row-${cycle.id}`}\n>\n```\n\nThis calls the `onSelectCycle` callback prop with the cycle ID.\n\n### How the flow works: **ActiveCycle.tsx**\n\n**File:** `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/pages/ActiveCycle.tsx`\n\nThe `CycleList` component receives the `onSelectCycle` handler at line 115:\n```javascript\n<CycleList\n  cycles={cycles}\n  loading={loading}\n  selectedCycleId={selectedCycleId}\n  onSelectCycle={handleSelectCycle}\n/>\n```\n\nThe `handleSelectCycle` function at line 55-57 dispatches `setSelectedCycleId`:\n```javascript\nfunction handleSelectCycle(cycleId: string) {\n  dispatch(setSelectedCycleId(cycleId));\n}\n```\n\n### Dispatch order when a cycle is clicked:\n\n1. **First dispatch:** `setSelectedCycleId(cycleId)` (line 56 in ActiveCycle.tsx)\n   - This is a synchronous reducer action that updates `selectedCycleId` in Redux state\n\n2. **Second dispatch:** `fetchCycleIssues(selectedCycleId)` (line 51 in ActiveCycle.tsx)\n   - This is triggered by a `useEffect` hook that watches `selectedCycleId` (lines 49-53)\n   - The effect only runs when `selectedCycleId` changes, so it fires *after* `setSelectedCycleId` completes\n   - This async thunk fetches the cycle detail data\n\n### CycleDetail conditional rendering: **CycleDetail.tsx**\n\n**File:** `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/components/CycleDetail.tsx`\n\nLine 255 shows the conditional rendering:\n```javascript\nif (!cycleDetail) return null;\n```\n\nThe component returns `null` if `cycleDetail` is null, preventing any rendering.\n\n**Additionally, in ActiveCycle.tsx** (lines 108-109):\n```javascript\n{selectedCycleId && cycleDetail ? (\n  <CycleDetail />\n) : (\n```\n\nThe `CycleDetail` component is only rendered if BOTH `selectedCycleId` AND `cycleDetail` are truthy. This ensures the component isn't even mounted until both conditions are met.\n\n### Test IDs found:\n- **cycle-row** test ID: `cycle-row-${cycle.id}` (line 53 in CycleList.tsx)\n- **cycle-detail** test ID: `cycle-detail` (line 305 in CycleDetail.tsx)"}],"totalDurationMs":12595,"totalTokens":33511,"totalToolUseCount":8,"usage":{"input_tokens":7,"cache_creation_input_tokens":15541,"cache_read_input_tokens":17155,"output_tokens":808,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":15541},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"}}}
