fetch dispatches, and the requestId matches when it completes. That actually works fine. Or the auto-selection could trigger first, causing a render and fetch with sprint 12, then the test click happens after.\n\nEither way, I'm stuck on why the cycle detail isn't showing up even though the row appears selected. Let me strip out the requestId logic entirely and just accept the race condition for now—run the tests again to see if I'm back to 6/7 passing, then I can debug test 7 separately.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":373,"cache_read_input_tokens":140573,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":373,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"1880e500-2182-4a27-9a5d-5f74c5e8203c","uuid":"65a8fc98-a58d-4b6a-9be2-743622857e1c"}
